cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Claim Plane in research, please cite the software. The related
  research papers are listed in the references below.
title: Claim Plane
type: software
version: 0.46.0
date-released: 2026-08-13
authors:
  - family-names: Nikolaev
    given-names: Maxim
repository-code: https://github.com/SkeinRank/claim-plane
url: https://github.com/SkeinRank/claim-plane
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Claim Plane is a model-agnostic coordination and verification layer for
  parallel coding agents, providing enforceable change intents, deterministic
  admission, dynamic scope control, and reproducible integration evidence.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - multi-agent
  - software-engineering
  - concurrency-control
  - code-generation
